  "description": "War hero and army captain Fedele Aske is haunted by the ghosts of his past, preventing him from getting any sleep at night without a woman to warm his bed. When one of his nightly companions turns out to be an enemy spy, Princess Igraine forbids him from taking any more women into his tent as his military adviser. But the lack of sleep greatly impairs Fedele’s abilities on the battlefield, leaving Igraine with no choice. She’ll just have to be the one to ease his restless nights from now on...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
